sit, 771, 777.</ITEM> <ITEM>Amphictyon, 1105.</ITEM> <ITEM>Amphitheatrum spiritale, 922.</ITEM> <ITEM>Anachoretae, 731, 733, 735, 746.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Anavlaboû</FOREIGN> , 1231.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Analambavnein</FOREIGN> ,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Analogeiðon</FOREIGN> , 889.</ITEM> <ITEM>Analogium, 889.</ITEM> <ITEM>Anastasius papa, 894.</ITEM> <ITEM>Anaxagoras Clazomenius, 863.</ITEM> <ITEM><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Anavxurideû</FOREIGN> , 1235.</ITEM> <ITEM>Andreas (S.), 1221.</ITEM> <ITEM>Angeli referunt nostras actiones
